this isn't a BioC question and you'd be better off with the r-help mailing list.

what you want is:

ids = c( "1_880238", "1_883625", "1_1222695", "1_2255524" ,"1_887560")
newdata = example[match(ids, example$V1), ]

another approach is

newdata = subset(example, V1 %in% ids)

