lumi depends on something that depends on the CRAN package rgl.
rgl has some system dependencies, as you can see on its home page:
http://cran.fhcrc.org/web/packages/rgl/index.html

The README for rgl has instructions for configuring your system.
Download the rgl source tarball (the "Package source" link on the page
above), open the tarball and read the README file.

Dan



